s thresholded contrast feature_010>=0 versus <0, measured on outcome_011 and outcome_008. These are scientifically informative because they test whether context-specific associations exist even when main effects are null. The one targeted refinement linked to H52 asks whether the feature_050 outcome_014 signal is concentrated in the feature_042 subgroup. If these interaction screens are also flat, the most informative conclusion in this dataset is that the tested measured predictors do not show robust, clinically meaningful associations with stronger CRISPR dependency across the examined outcomes, while broader modeling of predictor classes, interactions, or subgroups remains a necessary follow-up. All conclusions remain observational associations within the supplied dataset, not causal effects or generalizable claims."
